    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, night sweats or unplanned weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No loss of vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hearing loss or mouth sores</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations or swelling of the ankles</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>Cough resolved; no shortness of breath</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea on naltrexone; no black stools</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Gets up once at night to pass urine; no other urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Aching of the right thigh in cold weather at the site of the old bullet wound; no new joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Old scars well healed; no new skin lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dizziness on standing, numbness or weakness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Nightmares about twice a week; mood better; PHQ-2 1; no thoughts of suicide</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

