    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with the interpreter and with his consent. He named a health care agent from among his people and completed a health care proxy form; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. He said that what matters most to him is to be among his people, to keep working while he can, and to go home to his own country. He would accept treatment for any illness from which he could recover, and wants his own prayers and ways respected at the end of life as he will direct; those ways are his and are not recorded. The plan will be revisited yearly or after any serious illness. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
